  "description": "XDoc.Word is a C# Office Word library to read, convert, edit, create MS-Word documents in .NET Framework projects.\n\nXDoc.Word from RasterEdge is an advanced Microsoft Word C# library :\n * Generate Word from PDF or scratch\n * Convert Word to PDF, SVG, HTML, multi-page TIFF, JPG, PNG and many raster image formats\n * Edit, process, merge Word document pages\n\nCompatible with\n* .NET Framework 4.x, 3.x, 2.x\n* Windows, MacOS, Linux, Docker, Azure\n\nOnline Documents\n* C# How to Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/csharp-imaging/word-reading/\n* Email : support@rasteredge.com",
